# CGVD2013 geoid undulation fixture (BC south-west).
#
# N(lat, lon) = -15 + 5·(lat−48.5) − 8·(lon+123.6) metres — a smooth ramp
# covering 48.5..48.8 N, -123.6..-123.3 E (Sidney/Haro Strait). Values are
# stand-ins in the published CGG2013 range (~−13..−17 m) until the real BC
# extraction is committed (issue N2); the .mggeoid loader path is identical.
DATUM CGVD2013
LAT0 48.5
LON0 -123.6
DLAT 0.1
DLON 0.1
NLAT 4
NLON 4
VALUES
-15.0 -15.8 -16.6 -17.4
-14.5 -15.3 -16.1 -16.9
-14.0 -14.8 -15.6 -16.4
-13.5 -14.3 -15.1 -15.9